    {
      "id": "85c2e382-31ba",
      "name": "Readme",
      "colNumber": 26,
      "rowNumber": 112,
      "rows": {},
      "cols": {
        "1": {
          "size": 106
        }
      },
      "merges": [],
      "cells": {
        "B2": "Setup",
        "B4": "The Product Moves sheet list all done stock.move.lines with products having excise categories as List 1.",
        "B6": "The computation of Excise Move Type is done as follow and in this sequence :",
        "B7": "· Transfer",
        "B8": "· Production",
        "B9": "· Inventory",
        "B10": "· Exit to FD",
        "B11": "· Exit",
        "B12": "· Entry to FD",
        "B13": "· Entry",
        "B14": "· NA",
        "B16": "The Excise Quantity, Excise Amount, Packaging Units and Packaging Amount are signed, whether the move comes or exits the excise license locations.",
        "B18": "The List 1 is processed into Pivot 1.",
        "B20": "Custom formatting is applied to differenciate exits in red, entries in green and inventory in orange.",
        "B22": "A warning is displayed when all Stock Move sheet lines are used.",
        "B25": "Modification",
        "B27": "The setup can be edited to meet according needs.",
        "B29": "To introduce an additional dimension of processing, ex. the plato degree from product, the field has to be added on the product form and related on the stock move line model and stored.",
        "B30": "The Product Moves sheet can then expose this extra field.",
        "B31": "The pivot then needs to be extended to encompass the added column and the new raw field can be added.",
        "C7": "When origin and destination warehouses share the same excise license;",
        "C8": "When origin or desinaion location usag is Production (the other location being in the fiscal deposit warehouse);",
        "C9": "When origin or desinaion location usag is Inventory (the other location being in the fiscal deposit warehouse);",
        "C10": "When the location of origin is part of a fiscal deposit warehouse, and that the destination is a location part of fiscal deposit warehouse or a customer with a fiscal deposit fiscal position;",
        "C11": "When the location of origin is part of a fiscal deposit warehouse, and that the destination is not a location part of fiscal deposit warehouse nor a customer with a fiscal deposit fiscal position;",
        "C12": "When the location of destination is part of a fiscal deposit warehouse, and that the origin is a location part of fiscal deposit warehouse or a customer with a fiscal deposit fiscal position;",
        "C13": "When the location of destination is part of a fiscal deposit warehouse, and that the origin is not a location part of fiscal deposit warehouse nor a customer with a fiscal deposit fiscal position;",
        "C14": "When none of those criteria are met (as a fallback mechanism)."
      },
      "styles": {
        "B2": 2,
        "B25": 2
      },
